NAMING_VS_MECHANISM: NAMING, predominantly. 'bounded-W' = cache-residency-greedy priority + a classic anti-starvation/aging cap (admit any request skipped >= W times). The mechanism delta over greedy is "add aging"; over VTC is "add cache-awareness". Neither is a new mechanism — both are decades-old scheduling primitives composed. W=0 -> FCFS, W=inf -> greedy is admitted in-packet, confirming bounded-W is a continuous knob ALONG a known frontier, not a new operating point. No novel mechanism is established; and since the result is NEGATIVE (0/36 joint-dom), there is no novel positive contribution that needs protecting.

